{
  "title": "Model configuration",
  "date": "",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "English"
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "Model configuration"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Learn about the Claude Code model configuration, including model aliases like `opusplan`"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Available models"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "A **model alias**"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "A **model name**\n\nAnthropic API: A full **[model name](https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/about-claude/models/overview#model-names)**\nBedrock: an inference profile ARN\nFoundry: a deployment name\nVertex: a version name"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Anthropic API: A full **[model name](https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/about-claude/models/overview#model-names)**"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Bedrock: an inference profile ARN"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Foundry: a deployment name"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Vertex: a version name"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Model aliases"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Setting your model"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**During session** - Use `/model <alias|name>` to switch models mid-session"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**At startup** - Launch with `claude --model <alias|name>`"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Environment variable** - Set `ANTHROPIC_MODEL=<alias|name>`"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Settings** - Configure permanently in your settings file using the `model`\nfield."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "",
      "code": "# Start with Opus\nclaude --model opus\n\n# Switch to Sonnet during session\n/model sonnet"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "",
      "code": "{\n    \"permissions\": {\n        ...\n    },\n    \"model\": \"opus\"\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Special model behavior"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "default model setting"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "opusplan model setting"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**In plan mode** - Uses `opus` for complex reasoning and architecture\ndecisions"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**In execution mode** - Automatically switches to `sonnet` for code generation\nand implementation"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Extended context with [1m]"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "",
      "code": "# Example of using a full model name with the [1m] suffix\n/model anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0[1m]"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Checking your current model"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "In [status line](/docs/en/statusline) (if configured)"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "In `/status`, which also displays your account information."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Environment variables"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Prompt caching configuration"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Was this page helpful?"
    }
  ]
}